Usage (e.g. for placement `bottom`):

```jsx
const createHeight = (height: number) => `calc(100vh - var(--headerHeight) - ${height}px)`;

const onDrawerHeightChange = (newHeight: number) => {
    setDrawerHeight(newHeight);
    dispatch(setToolMenuMaxHeight(createHeight(newHeight)));
};

const onAfterDrawerOpenChange = () => {
    dispatch(setToolMenuMaxHeight(createHeight(drawerHeight)));
};

<ResizableDrawer
    afterOpenChange={onAfterDrawerOpenChange}
    drawerHeight={drawerHeight}
    onDrawerHeightChange={onDrawerHeightChange}
    open={isDrawerOpen}
    placement="bottom"
    title="My resizable drawer"
>
    <Card>
        <p>Some content</p>
    </Card>
</ResizableDrawer>
``` 


In addition, toolmenu is resized automatically when its used with a `ResizableDrawer`.

